### 7.3 The `article` component (the most-used evidence element)

V1 fields: `media: screenshot id or [ids], marks: [{box: [x0,y0,x1,y1] (0..1 of the screenshot) |
boxes: […] | phrase: "exact words" (the app finds it with vision), style: highlight|circle|underline|
redact|box, delay, duration, color, word (redact: scramble settles to it), item}], tilt, width, torn:
top|bottom|both|none, backdrop: stars|dust|plain|none, bg, bg2, curve?, edge_blur?, scroll: true|false,
coming_up: true|"text"`. Tall screenshots scroll and stop on each mark.

V3 extras: `fullbleed: true` (page fills the frame) · `enter: "slide_up_over"` (0.3 s expo-out over the
previous shot) · `exit: slide_left|slide_right|<animate_out preset>` · `tilt3d: true | {from: [22,0,-2],
to: [0,0,-1], duration: 0.5, at?}` (settles from a 3D tilt; lives in precomp `<id>_pc` shown by 3D layer
`<id>_3d`) · `perspective: {rx, ry}` · `drift` (push %, 5) · `theme: "dark"` (black page, text tint
#E8F07A + glow + chromatic aberration; `text_tint`) · `backdrop: newsprint_wall | newspaper_collage |
clean | grunge_red | grunge_navy | paper_grey | stars | dust | plain | none` · `lines: sequential (0.6 s per
line) | overlap | together` · `blend: "multiply"` (highlighter tints like real ink) · `highlight_color`
(lime #E5F51A on newsprint, pink #F0A0A0 on clean, yellow else), `pen_color` (#E0201B), `ellipse_style:
pen | loop` · `focus: [{mark, zoom: 1.9, duration: 0.35, at?}]` (punch-in centring a mark; zoom 1
returns) or a mark's `zoom: true | 1.7` · `scroll_whip: {to_mark, duration: 0.25}` · `embed: {media,
after_mark | box, width: 0.8, at?}` → photo layer `<id>_embed` (pair with `zoom_into_photo`) · `sfx: true`.

Mark extras: `style: brush | text_color (#D0202A / #E8F53A) | pen_circle (red pen ellipse 0.35 s with an
overlapping end) | counter_box {from, to, steps 6, prefix, suffix, decimals} | box | redact`, `at_word:
"spoken words"` (timed from caption word timings + 0.15 s) | `at` (comp s) | `delay`, `done: true` (already
drawn when returning to the page), `id, blend, lines, ellipse_style, duration, color`.

When: any document / web / news source is quoted → article (newsprint_wall + lime multiply highlight for
newspapers; clean + pink for web pages; dark theme for leaked / secret docs), 2 marks, hold 3–7 s, marks
0.1–0.3 s **after** the spoken keyword. **Evidence is always followed by a reenactment of the fact.**
Mohitflix: design our own neutral page images (no real logos / wordmarks); a `source_tag` under it.

