## 17. Recipes (full worked examples, Mohitflix style)

All times are examples; align them to the voice-over. Ids are yours to choose. Run each block as one
`run_commands` call, then `batch [check_scene, preview_shot]`.

### 17.1 New project + global look

```json
[{"op":"set_comp","duration":30,"background":"#0B0B0D","motion_blur":true},
 {"op":"add_layer","type":"solid","id":"look","adjustment":true,"color":"#00000000","start":0,"duration":30},
 {"op":"apply_style","style":"doc_teal_orange","layers":["look"]},
 {"op":"add_effect","layer":"look","effect":"grain","params":{"amount":18,"size":2}},
 {"op":"add_effect","layer":"look","effect":"vignette","params":{"amount":45,"size":65}}]
```
(`new_project {name:"NK EP01 test", format:"youtube", fps:30}` first; `import_media` the images.) Keep
the adjustment layer at the top (`reorder_layer {layer:"look", index:0}` after adding other layers).

### 17.2 Layered room with real parallax (manual rig)

Add layers back to front (each `add_layer` goes on top). Media: `m_bg` (room plate with furniture removed / back wall), `m_mid` (table + chairs cut-out),
`m_fg` (door-edge cut-out). Push toward P = (960, 520) over 0–7 s, drift D = −70.

```json
