## 19. Troubleshooting

| Problem | What to do |
|---|---|
| A command batch fails | The error names the command index + op; nothing changed. Fix that command and resend the whole batch |
| "Unknown effect param" | Check Appendix A.1 / `list_effects` for that effect's own params |
| Layer invisible | `get_layer`: start / duration, opacity keyframes, parent off-screen, matte hiding it, layer order (`layers[0]` is top), `visible` |
| Black frame / gap | `check_scene` (black gaps, layers ending early); transition motion blur (quirk 5) |
| Plate edges show during a move | Scale the plate up (≥ 120 % on the back rig), or `check_scene` 3D edge fix |
| Cut-out floats | contact_shadow, ground position, `check_scene` floating fix |
| Export fails | `export_status` error + `get_logs {level:"error"}`; GPU button; window not minimised; disk space |
| Edits refused "blocked" | An export / Director job is running: `job_status`, wait or `cancel_job` |
| App unresponsive / RAM high | `get_state` perf; MemoryGuard trims above 2 GB; save, close and reopen the project |
| Fonts wrong | Use a bundled family name exactly (4.9) |

