## 20. Keeping this manual up to date

- Source: `docs/MOTIONAI_MANUAL.md` in the repo. The app embeds it as `lib/remote/manual_text.dart`
  (generated: `python tool/gen_manual.py`), served by `get_manual` and `motionai://manual`. A test
  (`test/manual_test.dart`) fails when the two differ or when a tool in `kMcpTools` is not mentioned
  here — so a new tool can't ship undocumented.
- When you add an op / component / effect: update `lib/ai/command_spec.dart` (authoritative for the app's
  AI and `get_command_spec`), this manual, regenerate `manual_text.dart`, run the tests, bump
  `kMcpServerVersion` when tools change.
- New quirk found while working → add it to section 16 with the verified workaround.
- Appendix A is generated from the Dart catalogues (`python tool/gen_manual.py --catalog`).


