### A.3 Transitions (36) — `transition {from, to, type, duration?, at?, sound?, params?}`

From `DocTransitions.catalog` (doc_transitions.dart + doc_transitions_v3.dart). Shared params: direction (left|right|up|down), tone (warm|cold|neutral), target (layer), point [x,y], size [w,h], cx/cy (% of frame). `list_transitions {}` prints the live catalog.

| Type | Label | Best for | Default s | Sound | Own params |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `push_through` | Push Through | flying through a door, window, arch or screen into the next scene | 1.2 | whoosh | shape |
| `foreground_wipe` | Foreground Wipe | hiding a cut behind a pillar / tree / person passing the lens | 0.8 | whoosh | media, shape, width |
| `zoom_into_photo` | Zoom Into Photo | a framed photo / newspaper / screen in the scene becomes the next shot | 1.6 | swoosh_long | layer |
| `map_drop` | Map Drop | diving from a map or aerial view down through clouds to the place | 1.5 | swoosh_long, sub_drop | push |
| `match_cut` | Match Cut | two shots with the same shape (eye → moon, coin → planet) | 0.6 | swoosh_short | from_point, to_point, from_size, to_size |
| `whip_pan` | Whip Pan | energetic jumps between places or times | 0.45 | whoosh |  |
| `parallax_slide` | Parallax Slide | sliding between two 3D photo shots (make_3d precomps): layers move by depth | 1.0 | swoosh_long |  |
| `paper_tear` | Paper Tear | archive / newspaper stories: the shot is ripped away like paper | 0.9 | paper |  |
| `burn_edge` | Burn Edge | old letters, maps and photos burning away to the next scene | 1.6 | fire_bed |  |
| `page_turn` | Page Turn | book / diary / archive chapters: the page curls away | 1.2 | paper | angle |
| `focus_pull` | Focus Pull | calm, reflective moments; changing subject | 1.0 | reverse_cymbal |  |
| `dolly_zoom` | Dolly Zoom (Vertigo) | shock and realisation before a reveal | 1.6 | riser, hit |  |
| `film_burn` | Film Burn | flashbacks, memories, vintage footage | 1.0 | reverse_cymbal |  |
| `light_leak_wipe` | Light Leak Wipe | travel, warm nostalgic moments | 1.0 | swoosh_long |  |
| `ink_bleed` | Ink Bleed | history, art, handwritten documents | 1.2 | swoosh_long | tone, incoming |
| `smoke_reveal` | Smoke Reveal | war, mystery, legends | 1.4 | swoosh_long | tone |
| `bw_to_colour` | B&W to Colour | the past coming to life: an old photo blooms into colour | 2.0 | shutter |  |
| `glitch_cut` | Glitch Cut | tech, hacking, breaking news, tension | 0.6 | glitch |  |
| `flash_cut` | Flash Cut | camera-flash / impact cut on a beat | 0.5 | swoosh_reverse, hit | color |
| `dip_to_black` | Dip to Black | time passing, chapter ends, solemn moments | 0.9 | swoosh_reverse | color |
| `powder_burst` | Powder Burst | snowy / desert stories: a white powder cloud blasts across, full cover at the cut, flakes linger over the next shot (in/out of the presenter, any scene change) | 0.65 | powder_whoosh | kind, color, density, linger |
| `debris_burst` | Debris Burst | the most frequent documentary cut: ice / snow / glass / dust / leaves burst toward the lens, full cover for a few frames, debris clears over the next shot | 0.7 | ice_crash | kind, from, pre_roll, peak_cover, tail, tone, density |
| `frost_shatter` | Frost Shatter | cold / ice / mountain stories: frost crystals grow from a corner, then the shot shatters with a radial blur | 1.4 | ice_crash | corner |
| `zoom_blur` | Zoom Blur | evidence → reenactment / landscape, macro → presenter, leaving an archive photo on a pause | 0.45 | whoosh | zoom, flash, grain, cx, cy |
| `eye_reflection` | Eye Reflection | event → witness reaction: the event is seen in the pupil of the incoming eye close-up, which pulls back 5× → 1× | 0.9 | braam | point, size, opacity, linger |
| `holes` | Burn Holes | harsh exit from a gruesome still to the presenter: 30-60 burnt holes open and eat the shot | 0.5 | swoosh_reverse | count, size, rim |
| `shatter` | Shatter | impact moments: cracks spread, then the shot breaks into shards (tone ice = frozen glass) | 1.4 | ice_crash | tone, lead_in, shard_color, cx, cy |
| `slice` | Slice | fast topic changes: 3-4 horizontal bands of the next shot slide in from alternating sides | 0.4 | whoosh | bands, stagger |
| `slant_wipe` | Slant Wipe | a ~10° diagonal panel slides in from a side while the old shot (a map) compresses aside | 0.75 | whoosh | direction, angle, edge |
| `shrink_to_card` | Shrink to Card | footage shrinks into a bordered card with a shadow over the next shot (grunge red background): the shot becomes evidence | 1.0 | swoosh_short | size, bg, tilt, hold, border |
| `emerge` | Emerge | the next card / photo grows out of a point or layer (inverse of zoom_into_photo) | 0.75 | swoosh_short | target, point, from |
| `zoom_out_of_photo` | Zoom Out of Photo | proving a claim: pull back from a full-frame photo to reveal it inside an article / book page / screen | 1.1 | paper | layer, photo_box |
